<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">About</h2>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-image">
        <img src="/images/about-sage.jpg" alt="Sage Baggott" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          Sage is a third-generation drummer and composer from the Bay Area and
          Austin, Texas. Raised in nightclubs observing diverse musical styles
          from Western Swing to jazz and rock, he studied drums and Latin
          percussion from an early age.
        </p>
        <p>
          He has performed with organizations including Orquesta La Moderna
          Tradici&oacute;n, Los Cenzontles, David Hidalgo, Taj Mahal, QBA, and
          Awes&ouml;me Orchestra Collective.
        </p>
        <p>
          Currently, he composes for film and commercial projects as co-owner of
          Spiky Blimp, serves as co-percussion ambassador for Awes&ouml;me
          Orchestra Collective, and teaches private lessons from his Oakland home
          studio.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--bg-light);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-image img {
    border-radius: 4px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-text p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-text p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    }
  }
</style>
